<https://w3id.org/ontostart/suloized-pizza/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Release note (recursive expression rewriting): SpicyPizzaEquivalent now carries a full EquivalentClasses SULO definition (Pizza and hasPart some (PizzaTopping and hasFeature some Hot)); named-pizza topping/base restrictions use sulo:hasPart and topping spiciness sulo:hasFeature, with exact range guards so negated contexts (e.g. VegetarianPizza) stay faithful; Spiciness re-parented under sulo:Quality. Additive; validated consistent by rustdl." .
